@startuml
!theme plain

skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title 多线程 MCTS + GPU 推理协作流程

participant "主线程" as Main
participant "MCTS 线程 T1..Tn" as Workers
participant "GPU 推理线程" as GPUThread
participant "GPU" as GPU

== 初始化 ==
Main -> GPUThread: 1. 启动 GPU 推理线程
Main -> Workers: 2. 分配 N 个 simulation 任务到线程池

== 并行执行 ==
Workers -> Workers: 3. 各线程并发执行 Select (PUCT + VL)
note right of Workers: Virtual Loss 保证路径多样化

Workers -> GPUThread: 4. 投递局面编码到请求队列
note right of GPUThread: MCTS 线程阻塞等待 future

== GPU 攒批推理 ==
GPUThread -> GPUThread: 5. 收集 batch_size 个请求
GPUThread -> GPU: 6. torch::cat 合并为 batch → forward
GPU --> GPUThread: 7. 返回 (policy_batch, value_batch)

== 分发结果 ==
GPUThread --> Workers: 8. future.set_value 逐线程唤醒

== Expand + Backup ==
Workers -> Workers: 9. 各线程: Expand 创建子节点
Workers -> Workers: 10. 各线程: Backup 沿路径回传更新
note right of Workers
    expand: 创建子节点（需锁）
    backup: 沿路径回传, 取反 value,
    撤销 VL, 原子更新 N/W/Q
end note

== 汇总 ==
Main <- Workers: 11. 所有 simulation 完成
Main -> Main: 12. 从根节点统计 visit_counts, 组装 MctsResult

@enduml
